<title>INDIA: India's RBI repos auctions calendar for April.</title>
<headline>India's RBI repos auctions calendar for April.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Thursday announced the schedule for repos auctions in April.</p>
<p>The repos auctions will be open to parties holding SGL account and current account with the RBI.</p>
<p>The following are the details of the auction.</p>
<p>Date of auction  Date of payment   Period  Repurchase date</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>March    31	April     1	 4 days  April     5</p>
<p>April     4	April     5	 4 days  April     9</p>
<p>April     7	April     9	 3 days  April    12</p>
<p>April    11	April    12	 5 days  April    17</p>
<p>April    15	April    17	 5 days  April    22</p>
<p>April    21	April    22	 4 days  April    26</p>
<p>April    25	April    26	 4 days  April    30</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
